---
title: "accrue_interest (Pebble Protocol: Reserve)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_reserve: reserve = reserves.load_mut_by_type(coin_type)
    q_load_reserve --> q_calc_rate: interest_rate = interest_model.calc_interest(reserve.util_rate())
    q_calc_rate --> q_call_accrue: reserve.accrue_interest(repay_fee_rate, interest_rate, now)
    q_call_accrue --> q_check_time: last_updated == now?
    q_check_time --> q_skip: already accrued, return
    q_skip --> [*]: return reserve
    q_check_time --> q_calc_factor: simple_interest_factor = interest_rate * (now - last_updated)
    q_calc_factor --> q_calc_accumulated: interest_accumulated = debt * simple_interest_factor
    q_calc_accumulated --> q_update_debt: debt = debt + interest_accumulated
    q_update_debt --> q_update_reserve: cash_reserve = cash_reserve + repay_fee_rate * interest_accumulated
    q_update_reserve --> q_update_index: new_borrow_index = simple_interest_factor * old_index + old_index
    q_update_index --> q_set_index: borrow_index.set_value(new_borrow_index, now)
    q_set_index --> [*]: return reserve

    note right of q_update_reserve
        INV-001: repay_fee_rate is used as reserve_factor (protocol revenue share)
        INV-002: borrow_index monotonically increases
        INV-003: time monotonically increases
        INV-004: interest_rate depends on utilization (3-kink model)
    end note

    note right of q_calc_rate
        INV-005: util_rate = debt / (cash + debt - cash_reserve)
        INV-006: if util <= mid_kink: linear interpolation base_rate to borrow_rate_on_mid_kink
        INV-007: if util <= high_kink: linear interpolation mid_kink_rate to high_kink_rate
        INV-008: if util > high_kink: linear interpolation high_kink_rate to max_borrow_rate
    end note
